ota/jones-county"],["ARC or PLC in Jones County","/arc-plc/south-dakota/jones-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, February to March has come in under 90% of normal in 42 of 75 years on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle saw August to September at 182% of normal, while January to February sat at 58%. So far in 2026, February to March is at 29% of normal on the middle. Grid 28618 had its driest year in 1976 at 44% of normal.</p>"}
